<popup window="window1">Help (aggdef)</popup>

<window id="window1" title="Help (aggdef)">
	<h2>'aggdef' command</h2>

	Find out where to set your aggdef slider to be 1/1

	<indent>
		<strong><symbol/>aggdef &lt;attack time&gt; &lt;recharge time&gt; &lt;init value&gt;</strong>
	</indent>

	If you are lazy, just use

	<indent>
		<strong><symbol/>weapon &lt;drop weapon into chat&gt;</strong>
	</indent>

	Example:

	<indent>
		Your weapon has an attack time of <strong>1.2</strong> seconds and a recharge time of <strong>1.5</strong> seconds.
		Your melee/ranged init is <strong>1200</strong>:
		<cmd show="tell">aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200</cmd>
	</indent>

	<i>See <cmd>help syntax</cmd> for an explanation of the command syntax</i>
</window>
